{"availability":"available","full":"chapaevv123/pulse-arc","name":"pulse-arc","description":"Pulse x Arc - policy-controlled AI-agent execution, deterministic verification, and reproducible action proofs on Arc Testnet.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Python","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-12T12:03:28Z","updated":"2026-09-12T22:43:37Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":[],"demo":"https://chapaevv123.github.io/pulse-arc/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T08:19:02.345Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T08:19:02.345Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T08:19:02.345Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T08:19:02.345Z","discoveredVia":[{"kind":"x","name":"As Seen On X.com","url":"https://x.com/i/web/status/2099031808637558980","postId":"2099031808637558980","postedAt":"2026-09-13T07:05:55.000Z"},{"kind":"x","name":"As Seen On X.com","url":"https://x.com/i/web/status/2098764706122981566","postId":"2098764706122981566","postedAt":"2026-09-12T13:24:33.000Z"}],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T08:19:02.345Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Pulse — Arc is an AI-agent and developer-tooling integration that explores policy-controlled execution, deterministic verification, and reproducible action proofs on Arc.","Pulse is a larger opportunity and action-intelligence system. This standalone package exposes only the Arc integration layer: a bounded action model, explicit human approval, deterministic evidence, and a minimal proof registry. Proprietary discovery, production collectors, owner data, Telegram infrastructure, and private configuration are not included.","Arc provides an EVM-compatible testnet execution and receipt-verification environment with native test USDC gas/value semantics. A final receipt gives Pulse a deterministic boundary between an approved action and a public, reproducible proof reference."],"features":["Arc Testnet integration — a bounded adapter that talks to Arc Testnet (chain ID 5042002) only, verifying chain identity before any prepared action.","Policy-controlled execution architecture — the agent can propose an action but cannot self-approve; every state-changing action requires an explicit, scoped, human-approved reference before execution.","Deterministic verification — the adapter checks receipt status, block, and finality against the exact prepared action before anything is treated as executed.","Participation Proof — a canonicalized, reproducible action record (actionId, proofHash) computed with a fixed key set, sorted keys, and no floating-point amounts (see scripts/proofcanonicalizer.py).","PulseActionProofRegistry — a minimal, non-custodial onchain commitment layer for the two bytes32 values above. It has no token, custody, withdrawal, upgrade, admin mutation, or arbitrary external-call path."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/chapaevv123/pulse-arc/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"014b4b38ca7426ea15671367736337a1367bf13362744d4ae26ff42e4b3f16b7","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T08:19:02.345Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T08:19:02.345Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Pulse — Arc is an AI-agent and developer-tooling integration that explores policy-controlled execution, deterministic verification, and reproducible action proofs on Arc.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/chapaevv123/pulse-arc/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"014b4b38ca7426ea15671367736337a1367bf13362744d4ae26ff42e4b3f16b7","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/chapaevv123/pulse-arc/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T08:19:02.345Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-09-12T22:43:37Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/chapaevv123/pulse-arc/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T08:19:02.345Z","hash":"014b4b38ca7426ea15671367736337a1367bf13362744d4ae26ff42e4b3f16b7","originalBytes":5444,"storedBytes":5444,"truncated